    "markdown": "# Sección 3\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEscribe aquí el contenido de la Sección 3.\n\n## Ejemplo de tabla con el estilo del libro\n\n\n\n::: {#tbl-ejemplo-s3 .cell tbl-cap='Ejemplo de tabla'}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(gt)\n\ndata.frame(\n  Indicador = c(\"Indicador 1\", \"Indicador 2\", \"Indicador 3\"),\n  Valor = c(120, 85, 200)\n) |>\n  gt() |>\n  tab_style(\n    style = cell_text(font = fuente_bold, weight = \"bold\", color = color_secundario),\n    locations = cells_column_labels()\n  ) |>\n  tab_style(\n    style = cell_text(font = fuente_regular, color = color_texto),\n    locations = cells_body()\n  ) |>\n  opt_table_font(font = fuente_regular)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\\begin{table}\n\\fontsize{12.0pt}{14.4pt}\\selectfont\n\\begin{tabular*}{\\linewidth}{@{\\extracolsep{\\fill}}lr}\n\\toprule\n{\\bfseries \\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{Indicador}} & {\\bfseries \\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{Valor}} \\\\ \n\\midrule\\addlinespace[2.5pt]\n{\\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{Indicador 1}} & {\\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{120}} \\\\ \n{\\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{Indicador 2}} & {\\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{85}} \\\\ \n{\\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{Indicador 3}} & {\\textcolor[HTML]{1B2740}{200}} \\\\ \n\\bottomrule\n\\end{tabular*}\n\\end{table}\n\n:::\n:::\n",
